# Handoff note for the in-flight demo → usage-tree porting. Temporary by design: delete it when the
# porting lands. What outlives it belongs in docs/plataforma-ai-ui.md, F6.
PORTING-DEMOS.md

# Scratch harnesses for that same porting: they check a page's stages rather than the product, and
# PORTING-DEMOS.md carries the copy that matters. Delete them with it.
# The glob, not the bare name: these borrow Playwright from packages/ai-gates, so a per-page copy
# has to sit inside the repo to resolve it, and everyone porting a page makes one.
verify-stages*.mjs
shot-stages*.mjs
apps/docs/check-trees.mts

# The dev server writes its own PID and port here on every run. Tracked once by accident, and
# stripped out of every commit by hand since, which is a chore that only ever ends one way.
apps/docs/.astro/dev.json
